  "url": "https://mcp.quire.app/mcp",
  "description": "Quire is a project and task management tool for organizing work into nested tasks, subtasks, and sublists. This connector lets Claude work directly with your Quire workspace: create and update tasks, organize them into projects and sublists, set due dates, priorities, tags, statuses, and assignees, and search across projects and organizations. It can manage documents, chats, comments, tags, custom statuses, custom fields, insight views, and approval workflows, as well as time logs and task attachments. Read-only tools let Claude summarize project state, list recent activity, and answer questions about your tasks, while write tools handle everyday updates and bulk operations. Authentication is handled through Quire's OAuth so Claude only accesses the workspaces you grant it.",
